ly Beach Seclusion","Wild Dolphin Boat Tour"]},{"title":"Cabo de Rama Cliff Fort & Cola Beach Freshwater Lagoon","evening":"Private sunset yacht charter along Sal River with sparkling wine.","morning":"Visit historic Cabo de Rama Fort perched dramatically over deep blue ocean cliffs.","afternoon":"Explore hidden Cola Beach with emerald freshwater lagoon flowing into the sea; kayak in lagoon.","dayNumber":3,"highlights":["Cabo de Rama Ocean Fort","Cola Beach Natural Lagoon","Private Sunset Yacht Charter"]},{"title":"Braganza Heritage Mansion & Divar Island Ferry","evening":"Gourmet fine dining at Cavatina by Chef Avinash Martins (Modern Goan gastronomy).","morning":"Tour the 450-year-old Menezes Braganza House in Chandor with Belgian crystal chandeliers and ballroom.","afternoon":"Local ferry to peaceful Divar Island; cycle through traditional Goan villages.","dayNumber":4,"highlights":["Braganza Portuguese Palace","Divar Island Cycling","Cavatina Gourmet Dinner"]},{"title":"Leisure Morning & Airport Departure","evening":"Assisted transfer to Dabolim or MOPA Airport.","morning":"Spa massage at resort; seaside breakfast.","afternoon":"Pick up authentic Bebinca and Feni.","dayNumber":5,"highlights":["Resort Ayurvedic Spa","Airport Drop"]}]', '[{"name":"The Tubki Resort Patnem","tier":"Budget","perks":["Near Palolem","Pool"],"rating":4.4,"estPricePerNight":"₹3,000"},{"name":"Caravela Beach Resort Varca","tier":"Comfort","perks":["Direct Beachfront","Golf Course","Buffet"],"rating":4.8,"estPricePerNight":"₹12,000"},{"name":"The St. Regis Goa Resort / The Leela Goa","tier":"Luxury","perks":["Private Beach Lagoon","Butler Service","Spa"],"rating":5,"estPricePerNight":"₹32,000"}]', '{"flights":8000,"foodDining":5000,"accommodation":18000,"localTransport":1000,"activitiesSightseeing":3000}', '["South Goa secluded secret beaches GPS pin list","Private yacht charter operator direct WhatsApp reservation","Curated heritage mansion appointment guidance"]', '["Airfare and accommod